1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Rear wiper stopped moving?
Don't assume the motor's dead yet.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Most rear wiper failures are a blown fuse —
usually separate from the front's.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Check the fuse box first.
A blown one is a 5-minute fix.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Hum but no movement? That's the
linkage or motor — needs a look.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Worth checking the fuse first.
Stop by and we'll take a look.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Nick's Tire & Auto
